---
<section class="py-16 bg-brand-cream border-t border-brand-gold/20">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-6">Assessment is more than a test.</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10">
      A child's psychological or developmental profile cannot be understood from a single score. Careful assessment combines observation, developmental history, standardized measures and clinical interpretation to understand both difficulties and strengths.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-left">
      <div class="flex items-start">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-trust mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
        <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Parent/developmental history</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-trust mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
        <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Direct child observation</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-trust mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
        <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Standardized psychological measures</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-trust mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
        <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Behavioural information</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-trust mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
        <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">School information where relevant</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-trust mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
        <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Clinical interpretation</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start lg:col-span-3 lg:justify-center mt-2">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-trust mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
        <span class="text-gray-700 font-bold">Individualized recommendations</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
